CURRENT ISSUES: {{issues}}
ALL CORRECTIONS TO PRESERVE: {{all_issues}}
Edit the previous draft to fix every current issue. Preserve every earlier correction; do not rewrite unaffected claims unnecessarily. Check the prose as well as structured fields for consistency. Return the complete corrected JSON with valid evidence and all scientific conditions.

Review the following generated analysis against the supplied evidence. Check actual support, numerical and physical conditions, distinguish quantities, preserve personal interest/author facts, and ensure crossover questions are not already answered by the supplied paper. Report ONLY substantive errors, not stylistic preferences. Do not demand repeating a condition in every sentence when it is already clearly established in the same paragraph. Every reported error must identify the incorrect claim and the evidence-supported correction. Notes may state limited coverage. Output {"issues":[{"description":"具体问题（{{language}}）","severity":"error|note"}]}.
